00:18:15,170 --> 00:18:16,920
I figured that was the problem.

380
00:18:17,210 --> 00:18:20,130
This means I'm going to need
a lot of magic stones.

381
00:18:21,460 --> 00:18:22,540
Horned rabbits?

382
00:18:23,000 --> 00:18:24,960
They shouldn't be coming around anymore.

383
00:18:25,290 --> 00:18:25,880
Why?

384
00:18:26,330 --> 00:18:29,420
We made a ditch around
the whole village a couple years back.

385
00:18:29,670 --> 00:18:31,080
Oh, shoot...

386
00:18:31,380 --> 00:18:34,750
Even small monsters like those
can be dangerous to kids.

387
00:18:34,880 --> 00:18:39,420
That's not good. How can I get
more magic stones without any rabbits?

388
00:18:42,080 --> 00:18:43,250
Ow! Ow!

389
00:18:44,000 --> 00:18:48,830
Ow! Ow! Ow! Ow! Ow! Ow!

390
00:18:48,830 --> 00:18:50,960
Hey, Pelmoas. Got a minute?

391
00:18:51,960 --> 00:18:56,170
I heard you're pretty smart.
What can you tell me about magic stones?

392
00:18:56,750 --> 00:19:02,500
Magic stones? They're small gems that are embedded
in monsters close to their hearts.

393
00:19:02,960 --> 00:19:05,710
They're mostly used to power magic tools.

394
00:19:06,170 --> 00:19:09,170
Magic tools are items that activate
when used with magic stones.

395
00:19:09,460 --> 00:19:12,080
They have many different types of them
in the royal capital.

396
00:19:12,330 --> 00:19:13,420
Oh really?

397
00:19:13,790 --> 00:19:16,880
D and C-rank stones can be useful
for people in the capital.

398
00:19:17,080 --> 00:19:19,380
But E-rank stones are basically just trash.

399
00:19:19,750 --> 00:19:21,920
You can usually find them lying on the ground.

400
00:19:23,500 --> 00:19:24,080
See?

401
00:19:24,250 --> 00:19:25,210
Wow!

402
00:19:26,580 --> 00:19:27,210
Here.

403
00:19:27,500 --> 00:19:28,710
Thank you!

404
00:19:29,000 --> 00:19:29,630
You're welcome.

405
00:19:30,460 --> 00:19:33,420
Guess I'll need to scavenge
around the village for them.

406
00:19:33,960 --> 00:19:35,630
Time to call in backup.

407
00:19:37,790 --> 00:19:41,710
I was able to gather a bunch of magic stones
thanks to the help from some villagers.

408
00:19:42,170 --> 00:19:44,540
INSECT E

